<header class="decision-hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <p class="eyebrow">Family Travel Decision Dashboard</p>
    <h1>Epic Family Vacation: 30-Trip Comparison</h1>
    <p class="lead">A data-first ranking of 30 finished comparison itineraries (21 ranked, 9 excluded by family decision) &mdash; every score re-derived from the built-out trip pages (budget rollups, flight chains, verified June sea temps, PTO math) across ten axes. The ten short escapes below use the same evidence standard but stay outside this two-week ranking. The numbers, at a glance:</p>
  </div>
</header>

