    <div class="overview">
      <div class="ocard"><b>30 + 10</b><span>comparison plans plus ten short escapes (21 ranked, 9 excluded)</span></div>
      <div class="ocard"><b>$7.5k</b><span>lowest all-in floor: Portugal</span></div>
      <div class="ocard"><b>5 hybrids</b><span>Madeira/mainland &times; Crete/Sicily/Mallorca grid</span></div>
      <div class="ocard"><b data-preserve-date>June 24-26</b><span>Full days in Pittsburgh protected</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="seattle-rainier" aria-labelledby="seattle-rainier-title">
    <a class="separate-trip-card" href="mt-rainier-seattle-2026.html">
      <div class="separate-trip-photo">
        <img src="assets/img/mt-rainier-seattle-2026/google_hero_car_1.jpg" alt="Mount Rainier rising above the surrounding landscape" loading="lazy">
        <span class="separate-trip-badge">Separate 2026 trip</span>
      </div>
      <div class="separate-trip-body">
        <p class="eyebrow">Couples trip · September 4–8, 2026</p>
        <h2 id="seattle-rainier-title">Mount Rainier + Seattle</h2>
        <p>Four mountain-focused nights built around Skyline, Pinnacle Saddle, and Mount Fremont Lookout at sunset, followed by an easy Seattle finish.</p>
        <div class="separate-trip-tags" aria-label="Trip highlights">
          <span>4 nights</span>
          <span>3 priority hikes</span>
          <span>Fremont sunset</span>
        </div>
        <span class="separate-trip-cta">Open the itinerary →</span>
      </div>
    </a>
    <a class="separate-trip-card" href="seattle-olympic-2026.html">
      <div class="separate-trip-photo">
        <img src="assets/img/seattle-olympic-2026/hurricane-02.jpg" alt="Olympic Mountains beneath dramatic sunset clouds" loading="lazy">
        <span class="separate-trip-badge">Recommended fire alternate</span>
      </div>
      <div class="separate-trip-body">
        <p class="eyebrow">Couples trip · September 4–8, 2026</p>
        <h2>Olympic Peninsula + Seattle</h2>
        <p>Three nights in Port Angeles for Hurricane Ridge, Lake Crescent, and the Strait—the most dependable current substitute for Rainier-scale scenery.</p>
        <div class="separate-trip-tags" aria-label="Trip highlights">
          <span>4 nights</span>
          <span>Lower fire exposure</span>
          <span>Ridge + lake + coast</span>
        </div>
