    <div class="winner-grid">
      <article class="winner-card"><h3>Overall recommendation</h3><p><b>Portugal</b> leads at 43/55: the strongest budget headroom, 12 nights, three bases, and high novelty, despite a moderate Algarve fire band. It remains conditional on proving the exact Faro&ndash;Funchal date and accepting cool Atlantic swimming. <b>Madeira + Mallorca</b> is #2 at 41/55, subject to exact 2027 air and through-ticket verification.</p></article>
