      <article class="winner-card"><h3>Best domestic</h3><p><b>Oʻahu + Hawaiʻi Island</b> remains the highest-ranked passport-free plan. <b>Maui + Kauai</b> is the premium scenery alternative; California would win the mainland-road-trip niche but remains excluded.</p></article>
